---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";

const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-transparent text-gray-300 py-8 px-4">
  <div
    class="max-w-5xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start gap-y-8 p-8"
  >
    <div class="max-w-xl">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-200">
        San Andreas Roleplay no está afiliado ni relacionado con Rockstar, ni
        con SA-MP u open.mp, todo el contenido publicado es propiedad de los
        jugadores y no del servidor.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm mt-4">
        Copyright © {year}
        <a href="https://sarp.es" class="text-primary">SARP.es</a>. Todos los
        derechos reservados.
      </p>

      <nav aria-label="Enlaces del sitio" class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2 text-sm">
        <a
          href="/"
          class="inline-block py-1 text-gray-300 hover:text-primary transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary rounded"
          >Inicio</a
        >
        <a
          href="/reglas"
          class="inline-block py-1 text-gray-300 hover:text-primary transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary rounded"
          >Reglas de rol</a
        >
        <a
          href="/docs"
          class="inline-block py-1 text-gray-300 hover:text-primary transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary rounded"
          >Documentación</a
        >
      </nav>
    </div>

    <div class="flex gap-6">
      <a
        href="https://github.com/San-Andreas-Roleplay-ES"
        class="hover:opacity-50 transition-opacity"
        aria-label="Repositorio de San Andreas Roleplay en GitHub"
      >
        <Icon class="w-9 h-9" name="mdi:github" />
      </a>
      <a
        href="https://discord.gg/sa-rp"
        class="hover:opacity-50 transition-opacity"
        aria-label="Unirse al servidor de Discord de San Andreas Roleplay"
      >
        <Icon class="w-9 h-9" name="mdi:discord" />
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
